<title>UK: Council of Europe prices 3.0 bln FFR 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe prices 3.0 bln FFR 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by joint lead managers JP Morgan and Societe Generale.</p>
<p>The issue was launched on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE SOCIAL DEVELOPMENT FUND</p>
<p> AMT ***3.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    06.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.415   PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.74     SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     SALE LIMIT  US/UK/FR</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED APRIL 2007 AND OCTOBER 2007 OATS  NOTES   ***CLAUSE TO REDENOMINATE INTO EUROS POST-EMU</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
